{%- comment -%}
  ============================================================
  LIO MEGAPAGE — full LP body, CRO-optimized
  Replaces the previous megapage. All section markup, CSS, and
  copy ported from TheLioKit-Merged HTML, with the following
  CRO improvements layered in:
    1. Every major section ends with a CTA that scrolls back
       to the purchase block (#lio-cta) — no dead ends.
    2. Trust signals (4.6★, 3,086 reviews, TNO/Eurofins) are
       repeated near every CTA, not just hero.
    3. Mid-page mini-CTAs after compare and reasons reinforce
       the offer above the fold of each scroll.
    4. Urgency micro-copy ("Ships in 24h · Free EU") sits
       under every primary button.
    5. Final CTA expanded to a full conversion footer with
       payment badges + reassurance + 90-day guarantee.
    6. Mobile-first: stacked layouts, full-width CTAs.
  ============================================================
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="lio-megapage-wrap">

<!-- ============================================================
     COMPARISON TABLE — gradient hero block
     ============================================================ -->
<section class="lio-mp-compare" id="lio-mp-compare" aria-labelledby="lio-mp-compare-h2">
  <div class="lio-mp-compare-inner">
    <header class="lio-mp-compare-head">
      <h2 class="lio-mp-compare-h2" id="lio-mp-compare-h2">
        {{ section.settings.compare_title_pre | default: 'Why 150,000+ people' }}<br>
        {{ section.settings.compare_title_mid | default: 'choose' }} <em>{{ section.settings.compare_title_em | default: 'Lio' }}</em>
      </h2>
      <p class="lio-mp-compare-sub">{{ section.settings.compare_sub | default: 'Join the ritual revolution and step away from the substances that own you. The hand, the breath, the pause — without anything addictive.' }}</p>
